{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_32","type":"agent_message","text":"The even-dimension specialization is neutral-to-small but safe. The more promising masked-path issue is that the ragged `K` predicate currently sits in every pipelined iteration; I’m moving only the final partial block into a separate tail step so all full `K` blocks use unpredicated value loads."}}
